   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dreadful Wind and Rain**: back after 105 archived shows (749 days); rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Living Like a Animal Me and My Uncle**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2018-06-22.bs2018-06-22** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 58 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The set took place at the RiversEdge Amphitheater during the Whimmydiddle Country Music Festival in Hamilton, Ohio [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2018-06-22.bs2018-06-22**: taped by JB; source: CA14 cards > CA9200 + CA14 omnis > Tascam DR-70D [1]. Also: Recorded with CA14 cards feeding into CA9200 plus CA14 omni mics, captured on a Tascam DR-70D recorder [1]",
